WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.151
The rope snaps.

00:00:01.161 --> 00:00:02.337
Does it fall?

00:00:02.347 --> 00:00:02.794
First:

00:00:02.804 --> 00:00:04.807
it hangs on several ropes.

00:00:04.817 --> 00:00:07.396
Each rope alone can carry the car.

00:00:07.406 --> 00:00:09.174
Buffers at the bottom of the shaft

00:00:09.184 --> 00:00:11.278
cushion a hard landing.

00:00:11.288 --> 00:00:15.127
In 1854, Elisha Otis staged a dramatic

00:00:15.137 --> 00:00:17.767
public demonstration in New York.

00:00:17.777 --> 00:00:19.544
A governor watches the speed.

00:00:19.554 --> 00:00:21.444
Too fast, and it trips.

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:23.444
Safety brakes on the car clamp the

00:00:23.454 --> 00:00:26.004
steel guide rails and stop it.
